type: software
title: "StereoUtils_Py: stereonet, directional statistics and paleomagnetic utilities"
abstract: "Python software for stereographic projections and directional statistics (Fisher statistics, great circles, fold and reversal tests), VGP, paleolatitude and rotation utilities, thermomagnetic (K-T) and hysteresis data processing with MagIC export. Companion of STARpaleomag_Py."
